5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Hey everyone! I’m really excited to get this started. I just want to make sure whatever we pick actually works on the depot floor, not just in the office.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Kenji, the floor is critical, but I’m worried about the long-term financial bleed. We need to see the full lifecycle cost, not just the sticker price.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I agree with Mizuki. But I’m more concerned about operational clarity. Who is actually accountable when the system fails? We need defined ownership, not just cost projections.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I think we should check if the new system will break like the old ones did! I want to see the upgrade history of the dispatch tool.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"I hear your urgency. But remember, systems are only as strong as the people who maintain them. Let us look closely at the human cost of this transition.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, checking the dispatch tool history is smart. I’m also worried about the yard devices. Let’s see if the new system can handle our actual equipment.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, valid point. But I need to trace the renewal invoices. I suspect the real costs hide in those recurring fees, not the initial quote.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Mizuki, I’ll look into support ownership during the last winter’s outage. That will reveal who is actually in charge when things break.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, that sounds super important! I’m also picking the administrator retirements and hiring times. I want to see if we’re losing all our smart people!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, your concern for our people is wise. I will examine the depot supervisors and the last rollout to see how our teams truly coped with change.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, I’m picking the depot calendar and peak-season cutover. I need to know if the system can handle our busiest weeks without crashing.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, the calendar is vital for timing. I’ll examine the board minutes on capital requests to see how these costs were originally justified and approved.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will examine the warehouse rule changes after new accounts. I need to see if the system can adapt to our evolving operational requirements without constant manual intervention.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
